SPC1ormh7IYqKlRr8VXxgZcvtC3HqCM4HcWL-wZG3WnOu_Im_qoCT6geuPFBilvY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS0T0hFGCnWCXBB-ZBgZ3HxLRCfVXfPUlmATlZqIEu2ug&oe=6B0061E0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Police Chase Simulator VR", "keywords": ["Driving", "Police", "Simulator", "Racing", "Chase"], "long_description": "\ud83d\udea8 Welcome to Police Chase Simulator VR \ud83d\ude94\nStep into the shoes of a law enforcement officer and experience the thrill of high-speed car chases, intense cop action, and adrenaline-pumping crime pursuits in a fully immersive open-world driving simulator. Whether you're chasing down criminals, patrolling the streets, or enforcing the law, this is the ultimate VR experience for fans of car driving games and action-packed simulations.\n\nDrive Realistic Police Cars:\nTake control of a variety of police vehicles, from sleek cruisers to powerful SUVs, and navigate through a dynamic urban environment. Feel the rush of high-speed pursuits as you chase down suspects and bring them to justice.\n\nExplore an Open-World City:\nImmerse yourself in a sprawling open-world city filled with bustling streets, hidden shortcuts, and challenging terrain. Every corner offers a new challenge, whether it's a daring escape or a tense standoff.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Thrilling Missions and Challenges:\nTake on a variety of missions, from car chases and crime busts to emergency responses. Use your skills to outsmart criminals, avoid obstacles, and complete objectives in this action-packed VR simulator.\n\nRealistic car driving physics and controls.\n\nImmersive VR environments and stunning visuals.\n\nPerfect for fans of car driving simulators, police games, and open-world adventures.\n\n\u2b07\ufe0f Download Police Chase Simulator VR now. Whether you're a fan of car driving, police action, or thrilling simulations, this game delivers an unforgettable experience.", "short_description": "\ud83d\ude97 Dive into Police Chase Simulator VR! \ud83d\udea8\n\ud83d\udca8 Experience high-speed car chases, intense cop action, and thrilling crime pursuits in a realistic open-world driving simulator.\n\n\ud83d\ude93 Drive police cars, chase criminals, and enforce the law in immersive VR.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Perfect for fans of car driving games, cops and robbers, and action-packed simulations.\n\n\u2b07\ufe0f Download now and become the ultimate law enforcer! \ud83c\udf1f"}]}, "developer_name": "Devtitanx", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/devtitanx/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Devtitanx", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/devtitanx/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9896126993802690"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_964397271955107_2377197737981821038_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LsX0w6GHq4IQ7kNvwFKVdR5&_nc_oc=Adqly0ljcI2I1Q-E3i1rh1_G8kA2n3LcXs_JjA6LcY88TwLIWGEPYcnQNXtn5jzN4Dw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSuuN_y7kiq0Ab8TDq-OBRZ6-Ee4EsIgVjGFd1Gr4PFOw&oe=6B00873D"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false